		{
			"id": "AdCEIEjE2gzxQBCsf",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 32, DX 13, IQ 14, HT 15, HP 32, WILL 16, PER 14, FP 15, SPEED 7, MOVE 8, DODGE 11, DR 7. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
