		{
			"id": "Asl8mVV2r9fwbc6HG",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 89 (offense 42, protection 47), threat tier major, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "A5tprKur12iIYBVZ_",
			"text": "Fear Aura: The pit fiend can take a Ready maneuver to project an aura of fear. Everyone within 10 yards of the pit fiend must roll an immediate Fright Check (p. B360). If a victim succeeds at his Fright Check, he will be unaffected by this pit fiend’s Fear Aura for one hour."
		},
